sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Customer
  participant APP as Mobile app
  participant SET as SettingsContext
  participant API as Supabase PostgREST
  participant FN as transfer / _transfer_core
  participant DB as Tables
  U->>APP: Recipient, amount, note
  APP->>APP: Validate, create<br/>idempotency key
  APP->>SET: confirmMoneyAction()
  SET-->>U: Face ID or password
  U-->>SET: Confirm
  SET-->>APP: success
  APP->>API: rpc transfer (user JWT)
  API->>FN: run as SECURITY DEFINER
  FN->>DB: Check key (replay?)
  FN->>DB: Lock both accounts<br/>FOR UPDATE, fixed order
  FN->>DB: Balance from ledger,<br/>check funds and limits
  FN->>DB: Insert transaction, transfer,<br/>debit and credit entries
  FN->>DB: Audit entry, 2 notifications
  FN-->>API: transaction JSON
  API-->>APP: 200 OK
  APP-->>U: Result screen
